      "why_this_is_evidence_of_common_descent": "📖 Why this is evidence of common descent",
      "why_this_matters_2": "📚 Why this matters",
      "with_predator_cost_off_always_pick_the": "With Predator Cost OFF, always pick the showiest bird. Within ~8 rounds, the population is at maximum showiness (1.0). This is the Fisher runaway model.",
      "within_one_population": "Within one population",
      "year_0": "Year 0",
