      "you_kept_the_land_alive_but_it_is_fray": "You kept the land alive but it is fraying. Some zones missed their fire-return windows; harvests were thin in places.",
      "you_manage_a_forest_for_100_years_cult": "You manage a forest for 100 years. Cultural burns, prescribed burns, beaver dams, thinning, native seeds. Random events test your wisdom under uncertainty.",
      "your_land_is_divided_into_5_zones_each": "Your land is divided into 5 zones, each with its own habitat, its own cultural use, and its own fire-return interval. ",
