      "read_a_real_engineering_blueprint_deco": "Read a real engineering blueprint. Decode the welding symbol on the leader line: process? size? both sides? field weld? Critical shop-floor literacy.",
      "read_full_profile": "Read full profile →",
      "reading_blueprints_drawings": "📋 Reading blueprints + drawings",
      "real_welders_real_paths_real_wages_the": "Real welders. Real paths. Real wages. These profiles are composites drawn from documented Maine + New England welding career patterns + AWS workforce reports + Maine Department of Labor occupational data. Each one represents a viable path — not the only path, but proven ones. Names are pseudonyms; situations are representative.",
